  body: |
    # Income-based JSA international residence scope

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source lists restrictions on income-based JSA for a person who has come from abroad separately from the contribution conditions supported by foreign insurance.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 075330 and the onward 075550 reference; the passage identifies a distinct question but does not establish its complete test, current availability or applicability to UC.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 075330, PDF page 15](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a814b6a40f0b62305b8e2a8/dmgch0705.pdf#page=15)

